<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel T&amp;T renames subsidiaries.</title>
<headline>Keppel T&amp;T renames subsidiaries.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Telecommunications &amp; Transportation Ltd (Keppel T&amp;T) said on Wednesday it has renamed two subsidiaries for closer identification with the Keppel Group.</p>
<p>Its telecommunications division, Folec Communications Pte Ltd, is now known as Keppel Communications Pte Ltd while logistics arm, W&amp;T Logistics Pte Ltd was renamed Keppel Logisitics Pte Ltd, a company statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
